---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /articles.html
title: 文章｜赵荣力
description: 浏览赵荣力的旅行、美食、建站与科研软件文章。
activeNav: articles
isArticleIndex: true
---
<div class="main-content articles-page">
  <main class="articles-index">
    <header class="articles-heading">
      <p class="articles-eyebrow">WRITING <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> {{ collections.article.length }} 篇文章</p>
      <h1>文章</h1>
      <p class="articles-intro">旅行、生活与技术笔记，按时间慢慢收集在这里。</p>
    </header>
    <div class="articles-grid">
      {% for post in collections.article | reverse %}
      <article class="article-card">
        <a class="article-card-image" href="{{ post.url }}" aria-label="阅读{{ post.data.cardTitle or post.data.title }}">
          <img src="{{ post.data.cover or '/assets/images/icon/homepage.JPG' }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="640" height="480">
        </a>
        <div class="article-card-content">
          <p class="article-card-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.data.dateLabel or post.date | formatDate }}</time><span aria-hidden="true">·</span>{{ post.data.category or '文章' }}</p>
          <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.cardTitle or post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p class="article-card-summary">{{ post.data.summary or post.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
